# review scratch. The opencode-review job is told to keep its temp directory
# inside the workspace (TMPDIR=$PWD/.tmp) so it cannot trigger a permission
# prompt on /tmp and deadlock; the directory it creates must not then show up as
# an untracked change in the reviewer's own `git status`.
.tmp/
